{"code":"E5","wikidata":"Q1028691","wikipedia":{"en":"Phrom Phong BTS station","th":"สถานีพร้อมพงษ์"},"summary":{"en":"Phrom Phong station is a BTS Skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line between Khlong Toei and Watthana Districts, Bangkok, Thailand. The station is on Sukhumvit Road at Soi Phrom Phong (Soi Sukhumvit 39). The area is a popular shopping destination, and the station is linked by skybridge to EmQuartier, Emporium and EmSphere shopping malls with urban green space Benjasiri Park.","th":"สถานีพร้อมพงษ์ เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนสุขุมวิทบริเวณย่านพร้อมพงษ์ ในพื้นที่เขตวัฒนาและเขตคลองเตย กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Phrom_Phong_Station_platform.jpg/960px-Phrom_Phong_Station_platform.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Phrom_Phong_Station_platform.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/202307_Bilingual_signs_on_Sukhumvit_Soi_24.jpg/960px-202307_Bilingual_signs_on_Sukhumvit_Soi_24.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:202307_Bilingual_signs_on_Sukhumvit_Soi_24.jpg","author":"Jonashtand","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/202307_Phrom_Phong_station_sign.jpg/960px-202307_Phrom_Phong_station_sign.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:202307_Phrom_Phong_station_sign.jpg","author":"Jonashtand","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/202307_Platform_of_Phrom_Phong_BTS_Station.jpg/960px-202307_Platform_of_Phrom_Phong_BTS_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign